BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:VISIBILITY BRIGADE - Petaluma - E. Washington St. Overpass - ONGOI
 NG
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260423T170000
UID:1b93714e50c7d63f6e62e44da145c0a3@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/PetalumaVisibilityBrigade_20260111180603108891.png
DESCRIPTION:_This is a volunteer-organized event!_ Come join us on the Was
 hington Street 101 overpass (southside) every Thursdays\, to peacefully de
 monstrate against the administration’s corruption\, amorality\, and lies
 . This will be a regular weekly protest spot/time. Let’s show our commun
 ity that resistance is alive and active. Bring your signs and your spirit 
 and pass the word on.
LOCATION:Washington St. 101 Overpass (southside)\, East Washington Street 
 & Kenilworth Dr.\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94954
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisiblesonomacounty/event/794152/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
