 om 8-10 AM\, with various messages of hope and resistance. Please review t
 he various timeslots and click to sign up. Signing up really helps us orga
 nize consistent coverage! Let's show 10\,000 travelers an hour that resist
 ance is alive in Sonoma County! (Weather permitting!) Please sign up h
