DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260421T194500
UID:4b85f4491b09091f97d5fbe62e279230@mobilize.us
DESCRIPTION:Join fellow Indivisibles for meditation and support to reduce 
 stress\, anxiety and depression in these challenging times. Participants c
 an also increase emotional resiliency and personal confidence through inte
 r-personal and group support among participants. Meetups will alternate be
 tween virtual and in-person. (This invite is for the virtual sessions.) Si
 gn up for one or both. Drop-ins welcome! Sessions are for people new to me
 ditation as well as long-time practitioners and are led by volunteers
LOCATION:Virtual event
